PRIVACY POLICY FOR FAZENDINHAXR ON META QUEST 2, META QUEST PRO, AND META QUEST 3

FazendinhaXR is a virtual reality experience developed by Raí Rodrigues for the Meta Quest platform. We value your privacy and are committed to complying with all applicable privacy regulations, including the European Union's General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).

FazendinhaXR is designed as an offline immersive experience focused on exploration and interaction in a virtual farm environment. No internet connection is required to use the application. FazendinhaXR does not collect personal information, user statistics, gameplay data, or any identifiable information. We do not request, gather, store, or transmit any user data.

COMMITMENT TO PRIVACY

Raí Rodrigues is committed to protecting your privacy while you use FazendinhaXR on the Meta Quest platform. Below are the main points of this Privacy Policy:

Confidential Information

"Confidential Information" refers to any data or information exchanged between the developer and the user in any form. However, FazendinhaXR does not collect or process any personal or confidential information from users.

Ownership and Use of Data

All interactions within FazendinhaXR remain entirely local to the device. No data is transmitted, sold, shared, analyzed, or monetized. No third-party services have access to information related to your experience.

Duration of This Agreement

This Privacy Policy becomes effective when you download and install FazendinhaXR and remains valid for as long as you use the application.

Governing Law and Jurisdiction

This Privacy Policy is governed by the laws applicable in your country or region of residence. Any disputes related to this policy shall be handled under the applicable legal jurisdiction.

USER RIGHTS & DATA PROTECTION

Since FazendinhaXR does not collect, process, or store personal data, users maintain complete privacy during usage. There is no personal data to access, modify, export, or delete because no such data is collected.

DATA TRANSMISSION

FazendinhaXR operates entirely offline. No internet connection is required for gameplay or interaction. Consequently, no information — personal, technical, or gameplay-related — is transmitted to the developer or to third parties.

HOW WE PROTECT YOUR PRIVACY

We are committed to ensuring your privacy throughout your experience with FazendinhaXR. Specifically, we guarantee that:

* FazendinhaXR is an offline VR experience.
* No personal data or gameplay statistics are collected.
* No information is shared with third parties.
* The application does not track, log, or store user activity.
* No analytics or advertising services are integrated into the application.
